      <div class="tip"><span class="check"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0A0D0B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg></span>Milk qonasa yoki shishgan bo'lsa</div>
